     "dl.item.description": "Oracle Integration (OIC) Provides A Fully Managed, Preconfigured Environment That Gives You The Power To Integrate Your Cloud And On-premises Applications. Developers And Cloud Architects Can Connect SaaS And On-premises Applications Six Times Faster With A Visual Development Experience, Prebuilt Integrations, And Embedded Best Practices.&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAt The End Of This Training, You Will Be Prepared To Take On The Application Integration Professional Certification.\r\n\r\nYou Will Learn To:\r\n\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Understand OIC Components, Features, And Capabilities\r\n\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Create And Configure Connections (Adapter, Trigger, Invoke)\r\n\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Create Integrations (Application, Schedule, And Event Patterns)\r\n\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Map Data Using Lookups And The Data Mapper\r\n\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Leverage File Handling Options, Features, And Capabilities\r\n\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Configure Orchestration Actions And Fault Handling Logic\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nEmbark On A Successful Journey To Master OIC Integrations Design And Implementation\r\n\r\nInstructor: David Mills\r\n\r\nThe Course In This Learning Path Are Continuously Updated To Reflect The Latest Product Changes.",
